        "rationale": "The agent correctly retrieved hydrogen, methane, ethane, ethylene, acetylene and co for Transformer 1 at MAIN over 2024-01-15 to 2024-01-19, excluded co2/oxygen/nitrogen, and picked the earliest (2024-01-15) and latest (2024-01-18) complete samples. Arithmetic checks out: 2845+7406+5467+16684+7+32 = 32,441 ppm and 2900+7350+5450+16600+7+33 = 32,340 ppm, both Condition 4 (>4630 ppm); change of -101 ppm over 3 days = -33.7 ppm/day. The fallback rule was correctly evaluated and the timestamps used ",
